    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Context:\\nUser Request: Multi-modal task\\n\\nOther agents available for collaboration:\\nAgent name: writer.\\n\\nYou have access to swarm coordination tools if you need help from other agents. If you don't hand off to another agent, the swarm will consider the task complete.\\n\\n\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"Original Task: Write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nInputs from previous nodes:\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nFrom facts:\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"  - Agent: Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary, though I don't have access to current weather information for the city.\\n\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"\\nFrom weather:\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"  - Agent: Lisbon enjoys pleasant weather with current temperatures around 21\\u00b0C and clear skies, while this coastal capital city is renowned for its historic charm, featuring over 1,000 years of history, iconic yellow tram 28, and a vibrant blend of Moorish, Roman, and contemporary architecture along the Tagus River.\\n\"}]}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"reasoningContent\", \"content\": {\"reasoningText\": {\"text\": \"The user has provided a multi-modal task and wants me to write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts. They've given me two inputs:\\n\\n1. From facts: Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary, though I don't have access to current weather information for the city.\\n\\n2. From weather: Lisbon enjoys pleasant weather with current temperatures around 21\\u00b0C and clear skies, while this coastal capital city is renowned for its historic charm, featuring over 1,000 years of history, iconic yellow tram 28, and a vibrant blend of Moorish, Roman, and contemporary architecture along the Tagus River.\\n\\nAccording to the rules, I need to pass the gathered weather and facts to the writer. I should call handoff_to_agent with agent_name \\\"writer\\\" and include the gathered text as the message.\\n\\nLet me combine the information from both sources into a comprehensive brief that the writer can work with.\"}}}, {\"type\": \"tool_call\", \"name\": \"handoff_to_agent\", \"id\": \"handoff_to_agent_yger0et9779r\", \"arguments\": {\"agent_name\": \"writer\", \"message\": \"Lisbon Weather and Facts Brief:\\n\\nWeather: Lisbon enjoys pleasant weather with current temperatures around 21\\u00b0C and clear skies.\\n\\nFacts: Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary. This coastal capital city is renowned for its historic charm, featuring over 1,000 years of history, iconic yellow tram 28, and a vibrant blend of Moorish, Roman, and contemporary architecture along the Tagus River.\"}}]}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"tool_call_response\", \"id\": \"handoff_to_agent_yger0et9779r\", \"response\": [{\"text\": \"Handing off to writer: Lisbon Weather and Facts Brief:\\n\\nWeather: Lisbon enjoys pleasant weather with current temperatures around 21\\u00b0C and clear skies.\\n\\nFacts: Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary. This coastal capital city is renowned for its historic charm, featuring over 1,000 years of history, iconic yellow tram 28, and a vibrant blend of Moorish, Roman, and contemporary architecture along the Tagus River.\"}]}]}]" ;
