    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"reasoningContent\", \"content\": {\"reasoningText\": {\"text\": \"The user wants a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts. The system mentions agents: weather, facts, translator. Which agents are needed for a short brief on a city's weather and facts? Answer with a JSON list of agent names.\\n\\nWe need to output a JSON list of agent names needed. The user asks to write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts. The system says we have agents: weather, facts, translator. Which agents are needed? For a brief on weather and facts, we need weather and facts agents. Possibly translator not needed unless translation. So answer with JSON list: [\\\"weather\\\", \\\"facts\\\"].\\n\\nThus output JSON list.\"}}}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"[\\\"weather\\\", \\\"facts\\\"]\"}], \"finish_reason\": \"end_turn\"}]" ;
