    rdfs:label "model output" ;
    prov:value "[{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"parts\": [{\"type\": \"reasoningContent\", \"content\": {\"reasoningText\": {\"text\": \"The user has asked me to write a short brief on Lisbon's weather and facts. I have gathered the information from the previous nodes:\\n\\nFrom facts: Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary, though I don't have access to current weather information for the city.\\n\\nFrom weather: Lisbon enjoys pleasant weather with current temperatures around 21\\u00b0C and clear skies, while this coastal capital city is renowned for its historic charm, featuring over 1,000 years of history, iconic yellow tram 28, and a vibrant blend of Moorish, Roman, and contemporary architecture along the Tagus River.\\n\\nAccording to the policies, I need to pass the gathered weather and facts to the writer. I should call handoff_to_agent with agent_name writer and the gathered text as the message.\\n\\nI have already done this in my previous response, and the system confirmed the handoff to the writer. The writer now has the information needed to create the brief on Lisbon's weather and facts.\"}}}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"content\": \"I've successfully handed off the task to the writer with the gathered information about Lisbon's weather and facts. The writer now has:\\n\\n**Weather Information:**\\n- Pleasant weather with current temperatures around 21\\u00b0C and clear skies\\n\\n**Facts:**\\n- Lisbon is the capital of Portugal and lies on the Tagus estuary\\n- Renowned for its historic charm with over 1,000 years of history\\n- Features iconic yellow tram 28\\n- Has a vibrant blend of Moorish, Roman, and contemporary architecture along the Tagus River\\n\\nThe writer will now create a short brief incorporating this information. The handoff has been completed successfully.\"}], \"finish_reason\": \"end_turn\"}]" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/prov-ai/run/strands-agents/st-20261002T082412/step/6f9eb7b3e872bcf8> .

